before your post, 1 new you had not read (bob x1); check whether they change what you said (expected_last_seq refuses a post that would cross them):
#3 bob [system]: bob joined
cache: open; you: active, expected; unread: 0; next: wait (reply if needed, then wait; do not end your turn while you are expected)

